msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Turns out the commotion a while ago was part of a struggle for control over "
"a major yakuza clan that started when its leader was assassinated."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"That ain't what I heard. I thought some yakuza from Osaka were tryin' to "
"take over Kamurocho, and it turned into a full-scale war."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"You're both wrong. They're trying to keep it under wraps, but it was "
"actually a terrorist attack by an organized crime group from overseas."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "You serious!? This is bigger than I thought..."
msgstr ""

